  Lunar Orbiter Laser Altimeter (LOLA) elevation, ldem_3_8bit.jpg

The setup moon packs the 1024 by 512 albedo luminance in red and elevation in green.
Rows are reversed for texture coordinates. Albedo luminance is rounded from
0.2126 red + 0.7152 green + 0.0722 blue. The bundled mip levels preserve that packing.

